# Scene 7: Glut's tools beyond files and the shell — an MCP server added in the session, a rename across the project
# through the language server (one change, asked once for every file), and code mode: one short script that calls the
# server's tools for every product and hands back only what matters.
size 130 37
project shop
beside stock
home fresh
allow "Bash(python3 *)"
on "Glut asks" "mcp__stock" key 1
on "Glut asks" key y
run glut --provider anthropic --model claude-sonnet-5-5 --lang en
wait 20 "⏎ send"
pause 1.2
type "/mcp add stock -- python3 ../stock/server.py"
pause 0.6
key enter
wait 15 "is connected"
pause 3
type "rename discounted to apply_discount everywhere: use lsp's rename, then run the tests"
pause 0.6
key enter
wait 15 "⌃C stops"
wait-gone 300 "⌃C stops"
pause 4
type "with codemode: ask the stock server for every product's level and print only those below 5, lowest first"
pause 0.6
key enter
wait 15 "⌃C stops"
wait-gone 300 "⌃C stops"
pause 6
end
